sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant NextAPI as Next.js API<br/>/api/sql/*
    participant Auth as Better-Auth
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Okta as Okta IDP
    participant SPN as SPN Token Service
    participant Statement as Databricks<br/>Statement Execution API

    Note over Browser,Statement: Execute SQL Query (Full Auth Flow)
    Browser->>NextAPI: POST /api/sql/execute
    Note right of Browser: { sql: "SELECT * FROM...",<br/>warehouse_id: "abc123" }

    Note over NextAPI,Okta: Step 1: Validate User Session
    NextAPI->>Auth: Validate Session
    Auth->>DB: Get Session + User + Org
    DB-->>Auth: Session Context { userId, orgId }
    opt Validate Okta Token
        Auth->>Okta: Verify user token
        Okta-->>Auth: Token valid
    end
    Auth-->>NextAPI: User Context + Org ID

    Note over NextAPI,Statement: Step 2: Get SPN Token
    NextAPI->>DB: Get Organization SPN Config
    DB-->>NextAPI: SPN clientId + encrypted secret
    NextAPI->>SPN: Get SPN access token

    alt SPN Token Missing or Expired
        SPN->>SPN: Decrypt client secret
        SPN->>Statement: POST /oidc/v1/token<br/>grant_type=client_credentials
        Statement-->>SPN: Access Token (1hr TTL)
        SPN->>DB: Cache encrypted SPN token
    end

    SPN-->>NextAPI: SPN Bearer Token

    Note over NextAPI,Statement: Step 3: Submit Statement
    NextAPI->>Statement: POST /api/2.0/sql/statements<br/>Authorization: Bearer {spn_token}
    Note right of NextAPI: wait_timeout: 50s<br/>on_wait_timeout: CONTINUE
    Statement-->>NextAPI: { statement_id: "xyz", status: "PENDING" }

    alt Query Completes Quickly
        Statement-->>NextAPI: { status: "SUCCEEDED", result: {...} }
        NextAPI-->>Browser: { rows: [...], schema: [...] }
    else Query Takes Longer
        NextAPI-->>Browser: { statement_id: "xyz", status: "RUNNING" }

        loop Poll for Results (SPN Token Cached)
            Browser->>NextAPI: GET /api/sql/status/{statement_id}
            NextAPI->>Auth: Validate Session
            NextAPI->>SPN: Get SPN token (from cache)
            NextAPI->>Statement: GET /api/2.0/sql/statements/{id}<br/>Authorization: Bearer {spn_token}
            Statement-->>NextAPI: { status: "RUNNING" | "SUCCEEDED" }
            NextAPI-->>Browser: Status Update
        end

        Browser->>NextAPI: GET /api/sql/results/{statement_id}
        NextAPI->>Auth: Validate Session
        NextAPI->>SPN: Get SPN token
        NextAPI->>Statement: GET /api/2.0/sql/statements/{id}<br/>Authorization: Bearer {spn_token}
        Statement-->>NextAPI: { result: { data_array: [...] } }
        NextAPI-->>Browser: { rows: [...], schema: [...] }
    end

    Note over Browser,Statement: Cancel Long-Running Query
    Browser->>NextAPI: POST /api/sql/cancel/{statement_id}
    NextAPI->>Auth: Validate Session
    NextAPI->>SPN: Get SPN token
    NextAPI->>Statement: POST /api/2.0/sql/statements/{id}/cancel<br/>Authorization: Bearer {spn_token}
    Statement-->>NextAPI: { status: "CANCELED" }
    NextAPI-->>Browser: { canceled: true }

    Note over Browser,Statement: Query History (Optional Storage)
    opt Store Query History
        NextAPI->>DB: INSERT query_history
        Note right of NextAPI: user_id, sql, duration, rows_returned
    end
